@startuml Azure DevOps Log Retrieval Pipeline

' === Стили ===
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor LightCyan
}

' ========================
' 0. AZURE DEVOPS API
' ========================
rectangle "Azure DevOps REST API\n(https://tfs.org.dom/tfs)" as api

note right of api
  Доступ через:\n
  • PAT Token\n
  • Account, Organization, Project\n
  • API URL: /_apis/pipelines, /builds, /logs\n
  → Requires authentication
end note

' ========================
' 1. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (OBOSOBNY BLOK)
' ========================
rectangle ".env\nTFS_PAT_TOKEN='...'\nTFS_ACCOUNT='Username'\nTFS_ORGANIZATION='Organization'\nTFS_PROJECT='Project'\nTFS_API_URL='https://tfs.org.dom/tfs'" as env

' ========================
' 2. PYTHON SCRIPTS
' ========================
rectangle "get-pipelines.py" as get_pipelines
rectangle "get-builds.py pipeline_id5" as get_builds
rectangle "get-logs.py pipeline_id5 buid_id1" as get_logs

' === ОДНА СТРЕЛКА ОТ .env КО ВСЕМ СКРИПТАМ ===
env --> get_pipelines : load config
env --> get_builds : load config
env --> get_logs : load config

' ========================
' 3. DATA FLOW
' ========================
rectangle "pipelines.csv\nID,Name,Folder\npipeline_id1,Pipeline Name1,\\path-to-repo\\app1\n..." as pipelines_csv

get_pipelines --> pipelines_csv : fetch pipelines

rectangle "pipeline_id-successed-builds.csv\nRun ID,Name,State,Result,Created Date,Finished Date,Pipeline Name\nbuid_id1,version1,completed,succeeded,2025-10-27T12:37:23.5208593Z,2025-10-27T13:08:02.8185187Z,Pipeline Name5\n..." as builds_csv

pipelines_csv --> get_builds : pipeline_id
get_builds --> builds_csv : fetch builds

rectangle "pipeline_id-build_id-logs.csv\nID,Lines,Created,URL,Last Changed\n2,23,2020-11-12T06:14:33.747Z,https://tfs.org.dom/tfs/.../logs/2,2020-11-12T06:14:33.747Z\n..." as logs_csv

builds_csv --> get_logs : pipeline_id, build_id
get_logs --> logs_csv : fetch log metadata

rectangle "pipeline_id-build_id-logs_content.txt\n2020-11-12T06:14:33.7066124Z ##[section]Starting: Prepare job Job_1\n2020-11-12T06:14:33.7222246Z ContinueOnError: False\n2020-11-12T06:14:33.7222246Z TimeoutInMinutes: 180\n..." as logs_content

get_logs --> logs_content : download raw logs

' === Arrows with Colors ===
api -[#Blue]-> get_pipelines : API access

get_pipelines -[#DarkGreen]-> pipelines_csv : pipelines
pipelines_csv -[#Purple]-> get_builds : pipeline_id
get_builds -[#Teal]-> builds_csv : builds
builds_csv -[#Orange]-> get_logs : pipeline_id, build_id
get_logs -[#Red]-> logs_csv : log metadata
get_logs -[#Red]-> logs_content : raw logs

' === NOTES ===
note right of env
  Environment variables:\n
  • Centralized config\n
  • Loaded by all scripts\n
  → One source of truth
end note

note right of get_pipelines
  Fetch all pipelines:\n
  • GET /_apis/pipelines\n
  • Output: pipelines.csv\n
  • Used to iterate over pipelines
end note

note right of get_builds
  Fetch builds for pipeline:\n
  • GET /_apis/pipelines/{id}/runs\n
  • Filter: only succeeded builds\n
  • Output: builds.csv per pipeline
end note

note right of get_logs
  Fetch logs for build:\n
  • GET /_apis/pipelines/{id}/runs/{buildId}/logs\n
  • Download each log file\n
  • Combine into logs_content.txt
end note

note right of logs_content
  Raw log content:\n
  • With timestamps\n
  • With ##[section], ##[error]\n
  • Ready for cleaning → next step
end note

caption Azure DevOps Log Retrieval Pipeline\n.env → Python Scripts → Pipelines → Builds → Logs → Raw Content
footer Created: November 10, 2025 | Data collection flow for UnifiedLogBERT

@enduml